## 2026-09-05 — Reboot: DualSense Recovered; Login Pointer Service Validated Cold

- Rebooted at `2026-09-05 22:25:29`. SSH recovered on the same address `192.168.1.204`, and the desktop-first state held: `media-home.service` still disabled and inactive, no Kodi process.
