- Branched `feature/0.015-desktop-first-home` from the committed Spec 009 work and wrote `plan.md` and `tasks.md` before touching the appliance.
- T001 baseline before any change: `media-home.service` enabled but failed, GDM `AutomaticLoginEnable=true` / `AutomaticLogin=dfish`, SSH active, graphical seat0 session present, Kodi installed at `2:21.3+dfsg-1ubuntu1`. GNOME settings baseline recorded in `plan.md`.
